@startuml
title V4-2 AceCommander Initial Visualization Queries
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
left to right direction

actor User
component "Raw ContentSummary view" as Raw
component "Tag universe + Any/All selector" as Selector
component "Token timeline" as Timeline
component "Authorization and query service" as Service
database "Ace ContentSummary projection" as Summary
database "ATAPUtilities Tag as-of reader" as Tags
database "Ace AISupervisor telemetry" as Telemetry

User --> Raw
User --> Selector
User --> Timeline
Raw --> Service
Selector --> Service
Timeline --> Service
Service --> Summary
Service --> Tags
Service --> Telemetry

note bottom of Service
  Authorization occurs before filtering,
  counting, grouping, or pagination.
end note

note bottom of Timeline
  UTC buckets; harness/model/effort filters.
  Missing counts remain visibly missing.
end note
@enduml
